{"id":"7820e9a540965dd4","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-minimal-below-ce.md","title":"非零 c.e. 度下存在极小度","display":"thm-minimal-below-ce — 非零 c.e. 度下存在极小度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-minimal-below-ce","aliases":["20-thm-minimal-below-ce"],"display":"thm-minimal-below-ce — 非零 c.e. 度下存在极小度","chapter":"13","section":"13.7","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-proof-pending","source_reference":"Theorem 13.7.1；Corollary 7.5.5 的严格性推论","source_pdf_pages":[193,238],"source_printed_pages":[159,208],"depends_on":["[[20-df-minimal]]","[[20-df-redeg]]","[[20-thm-minimal-not-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-minimal-below-ce"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-minimal-below-ce</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-minimal-below-ce — 非零 c.e. 度下存在极小度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"13"},{"key":"section","html":"13.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-proof-pending"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 13.7.1；Corollary 7.5.5 的严格性推论"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>193</span><span>238</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>159</span><span>208</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" href=\"?note=b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" title=\"20-df-minimal\">20-df-minimal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e805bd83d9457983\" href=\"?note=e805bd83d9457983\" title=\"20-thm-minimal-not-re\">20-thm-minimal-not-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\">\\(\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" href=\"?note=b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" title=\"20-df-minimal\">20-df-minimal</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e805bd83d9457983\" href=\"?note=e805bd83d9457983\" title=\"20-thm-minimal-not-re\">20-thm-minimal-not-re</a>。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>本条状态为 source-statement-proof-pending；正文给出修订后的定义或命题草案，尚缺完整来源核对或独立证明。不可仅凭文件类型将其作为已认证定理使用。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}below\\text{-}ce}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\ [\\operatorname{Minimal}(\\mathbf a)\\land\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf b].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}below\\text{-}ce}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\ [\\operatorname{Minimal}(\\mathbf a)\\land\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf b].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 13.7.1 给出极小度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf b\">\\(\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf b\\)</span>。既有极小度非 c.e. 度定理排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a=\\mathbf b\">\\(\\mathbf a=\\mathbf b\\)</span>，因此本条的严格下界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf b\">\\(\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf b\\)</span> 有独立依据；不靠把书中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> 直接抄作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>。极小下度本身不是 c.e.。§13.7 只给允许法构造的极简略草图，并将完整材料指向 Lerman／Epstein；本条的存在性构造证明仍待补，新增严格性论证不消除该边界。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 13.7.1；Corollary 7.5.5 的严格性推论；印刷页 159, 208；PDF 第 193, 238 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-minimal","status":"resolved","id":"b8c49b6cb74c57b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-minimal]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-minimal-not-re","status":"resolved","id":"e805bd83d9457983","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-minimal-not-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-minimal","status":"resolved","id":"b8c49b6cb74c57b6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-thm-minimal-not-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-thm-minimal-not-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-minimal-not-re","status":"resolved","id":"e805bd83d9457983","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-thm-minimal-not-re]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}below\\text{-}ce}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\ [\\operatorname{Minimal}(\\mathbf a)\\land\\mathbf a<\\mathbf b].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf a=\\mathbf b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf a<\\mathbf b","display":false},{"tex":"\\le","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false}],"bytes":1843,"backlinks":[{"id":"4011ec29b6dff303","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-minimal-below-ce]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-362","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-minimal-below-ce]] — 章 13；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-362","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-minimal-below-ce]]"}],"outgoing":["b8c49b6cb74c57b6","f389bdba28de0478","e805bd83d9457983"]}